Apache Jena Fuseki (production T3 backend) is an out-of-process service accessed
over the version-stable SPARQL 1.1 Query + Graph Store Protocol (HTTP). The
CLIENT ADAPTER ships here (src/ne/brain_ontology/store/fuseki.py); Fuseki itself
— the server, the JVM distribution, and any container image — is NOT distributed
with this package (like TEI/Qdrant in ne-brain's NOTICE). Current upstream
release is Apache Jena Fuseki 6.1.0 (Apache-2.0, requires Java 21); the tier-3
spec named "5.x" — the drift is immaterial to this adapter (SPARQL 1.1 protocol
is version-stable), but the future deploy/compose lane must pin against 6.x/Java-21.
